From: Q1000K development <q1000k@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] connect physical namespace replacement to service records

Serialize complete record snapshots and publication with legacy control
transactions. Route public data GEM and T-CONT removals through the full
physical drain/rebuild path, preserving the registration-owned OMCC.

